#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Auxo Settings — change how Auxo looks and works, without a terminal.

Every change goes through auxo-tweak, so the app and the command line always agree:
look settings run as you (`auxo-tweak look set …`), system changes ask for your password
with the normal graphical prompt (`pkexec auxo-tweak …`) and show their progress live.
"""
